--- !u!114 &1389611845
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1389611844}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fd8f1f66829c9894c9a8e8fac23a02e8, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialCanvas: {fileID: 1688658605}
  tutorialPanel: {fileID: 1064357091}
  tutorialText: {fileID: 486950664}
  nextButton: {fileID: 1457739145}
  characterImage: {fileID: 1019774045}
  audioSource: {fileID: 969282261}
  nextSceneName: SampleScene
  steps:
  - tutorialText: Nyiram udh, bersihin jalan udh, kasih pupuk udh, perhatiin Pohon
      Sihir Agung juga udh apa lagi ya
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fbab7f3a8767be54db5d1bcfbbdb2c3a, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: "istirahat aja deh, enak nya\u2026"
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fbab7f3a8767be54db5d1bcfbbdb2c3a, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: istirahat..?
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f10ba7b1b9164974b9fe94ac1336519a, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: "\u2026..?"
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fbab7f3a8767be54db5d1bcfbbdb2c3a, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: kamu lagi? Ngapain kamu ke sini masih blm kapok?
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b12adad9b98ca7047a7080a186afaa0c, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: Selama aku belum bisa mendapatkan sihir dari pohon Agung, aku gak
      akan nyerah. Setelah menyerap inti pohon itu aku akan bertambah kuat mengusai
      alam dan sihir hahahahahah
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ca1544a8ca1679c4a81d7e5a3e7039ab, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: cih mungkin kamu bisa lawan para penjaga, tapi gak dengan ku
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 817072bf754a9524e80840601d5a3efd, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: anak anak hama ku, serang! Jangan kasih ruang
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ca1544a8ca1679c4a81d7e5a3e7039ab, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: (huh kaya nya bakal lama nih) ok sini, tapi ingat JANGAN PERNAH
      SENTUH POHON KU!
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2f71aa75a4b3d6e4e9d15b4bd5adac82, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: pemain aku butuh bantuan mu, penyihir Sufra sedang menyerang, ada
      hal yang perlu kamu perhatikan
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: afcf92a41cc3b9648ab73cf5e82bbe1d, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: untuk bergerak tombol W,A,S,D. ya pasti kalian udh udh tahu
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2f71aa75a4b3d6e4e9d15b4bd5adac82, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: Button shift untuk RUN
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: afcf92a41cc3b9648ab73cf5e82bbe1d, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: untuk menembak mouse L dan untuk membidik Mouse R
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2f71aa75a4b3d6e4e9d15b4bd5adac82, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: pertama senjata, tabel ini adalah info ammo, jangan khawatir ini
      pistol sihir tidak menggunakan peluru namun daya tembak sihir terbatas
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: afcf92a41cc3b9648ab73cf5e82bbe1d, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: Bisa kalian lihat jika di pojok kiri bawah terdapat jumlah ammo
      kalian
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: afcf92a41cc3b9648ab73cf5e82bbe1d, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: 
    uiToShow: {fileID: 1941456000}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 0}
    hidePanel: 1
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: Jangan lupa tekan tombol R untuk reload
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 1941456000}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: afcf92a41cc3b9648ab73cf5e82bbe1d, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: 'Selanjutnya, pada bagian kanan atas terdapat jumlah hama '
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2f71aa75a4b3d6e4e9d15b4bd5adac82, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: 
    uiToShow: {fileID: 132986440}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 0}
    hidePanel: 1
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: Terakhir pada bagian pojok kiri atas terdapat HP pohon agung ,
      hama akan fokus pada pohon agung jadi hati hati lah jangan sampai lengah
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 132986440}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: afcf92a41cc3b9648ab73cf5e82bbe1d, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: 
    uiToShow: {fileID: 1010466768}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 0}
    hidePanel: 1
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: Ingat kamu diberi beberapa menit untuk melindungi pohon agung,
      jadi tetap fokus
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 1010466768}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2f71aa75a4b3d6e4e9d15b4bd5adac82, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: Ingat kamu diberi beberapa menit untuk melindungi pohon agung,
      jadi tetap fokus
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2f71aa75a4b3d6e4e9d15b4bd5adac82, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialText: Ini saat nya, kita bergerak sekarang!
    uiToShow: {fileID: 0}
    uiToHide: {fileID: 0}
    characterExpression: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2f71aa75a4b3d6e4e9d15b4bd5adac82, type: 3}
    hidePanel: 0
    stepSound: {fileID: 0}
